# JetBrains / Junie example

Use this when working with JetBrains AI Assistant or Junie-style workflows.

## Rules

- inspect project docs before editing;
- keep diffs small and reviewable;
- ask before changing more than 10 files;
- stop on migrations, auth, payments or cross-layer rewrites;
- do not run destructive commands;
- report changed files, validation and risks.
